      <t:profileDesc xmlns:t="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0">
         <t:abstract>
            <t:p>One of the two homilies on Melchizedek's origin attributed to <t:persName ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/PRS3255CyrilI">Cyril I</t:persName>. Both homilies according to  <t:bibl><t:ptr target="bm:Dillmann1866Chrestomathia"/></t:bibl> were translated from the Greek,
               but the original is lost and the Ethiopic version is the only known one, see
                     <t:bibl><t:ptr target="bm:CPG3"/></t:bibl>. Its Gǝʿǝz version known to be transmitted as
               part of <t:title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3309Qerellos">Qerǝllos</t:title> or along the <t:title ref="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT2365Storyo">Story of Melchizedek</t:title> .
            </t:p>
         </t:abstract>
         <t:langUsage>
            <t:language ident="en">English</t:language>
            <t:language ident="gez">Gǝʿǝz</t:language>
         </t:langUsage>
